        "id": 1899057
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T23:35:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we made HCI packet by SDU. One packet (or SDU) by interval. The increment appends before a possible discard due to ISO credit just after.\nIdeally, the Audio HAL shall generate the Sequence Number before crossing any FIFO but it needs architectural change. We can suppose here that there has been no loss since the generation.\nI am not sure I am answering correctly, can you precise what do you mean ?",
